metadata.notes:
Version 2.0.0 contains:
- 25 videos for scenario 1 and 24 videos for scenario 2. For each video, different resolutions are available: full resolution (1920x1080), medium resolution (960x540) and low resolution (640x360). Post treatment was applied on videos to blur faces of people and car plates;
- audio annotation files for both scenarios;
- visual annotation files for both scenarios.
